flowchart TD
    Need[Business outcome and target constraints] --> Choice{Portability justified?}
    Choice -->|No| Simple[Local module or remote API]
    Choice -->|Yes| Contract[Versioned semantic contract and core]
    Contract --> Load[Load bounded artifact and contract]
    Load --> Identity{Trusted provenance and binding?}
    Identity -->|No| Reject[Reject and record reason]
    Identity -->|Yes| Shape{Structure and semantics valid?}
    Shape -->|No| Reject
    Shape -->|Yes| Policy{Authority and fresh policy permit?}
    Policy -->|No| Reject
    Policy -->|Yes| Target{Actual ABI and imports supported?}
    Target -->|No| Reject
    Target -->|Yes| Envelope[Bind host envelope and scoped grants]
    Envelope --> Bounds[Input and state preconditions; guest and host limits]
    Bounds --> Run[Execute portable core; mediate host effects]
    Run --> Output{Output and effect preconditions valid?}
    Output -->|No| Recover[Fail or reconcile ambiguous effects]
    Output -->|Yes| Commit[Commit with required state and event atomicity]
    Commit --> Evidence[Lifecycle evidence and observed quality]
    Recover --> Evidence
    Reject --> Evidence
    Evidence --> Result[Explicit success, degradation, denial, or failure]
    Envelope -. Browser JS adapter .-> Browser[Browser engine and Worker lifecycle]
    Envelope -. Versioned WASI adapter .-> Server[Edge or cloud embedding]
    Envelope -. Native adapter .-> Native[OS and process controls]
